L109: Ethics statement
L110: The studies involving humans were approved by University of Newcastle Human Ethics Review Committee. The studies were conducted in accordance with the local legislation and institutional requirements. Written informed consent for participation in this study was provided indicate that both adults (over 18 years) and children (under 18 years) participated in the study.
